{
    "title": "HondaLink",
    "description": "New for 2024 Prologue: with the HondaLink app, you can take control with remote commands, check your charge status, locate your vehicle, and redeem your charging credits* for EVgo charging network. Activate HondaLink Connected by OnStar in the app for safety and connectivity services.\r\n\r\nUse HondaLink\u00ae app with compatible Honda vehicles to access features such as remote commands, vehicle status, scheduling service appointments, roadside assistance, and more.\r\n\r\nCheck vehicle compatibility: hondalink.honda.com/#/compatibility\r\n\r\nFeatures availability:\r\nThe HondaLink\u00ae app has exciting remote control features like Remote Engine Start, Remote Door Lock/Unlock, and Find My Car. Available for 2018+ Odyssey Touring/Elite, 2018-2022 Accord Touring and 2023+ Accord all trims, 2019+ Insight Touring, 2019+ Pilot Touring/Elite/Black Edition*, 2019+ Passport Touring/Elite*, 2023+ Civic Type R*, 2023+ CR-V Sport Touring Hybrid, and 2023+ Pilot Touring/Elite vehicles. Battery charge monitoring and control is available for Clarity Electric and Plug-in Hybrid vehicles.\r\n\r\n*Remote Engine Start is currently not available for 2019-2022 Pilot Touring/Elite/Black Edition, 2019+ Passport Touring/Elite, and 2023+ Civic Type R vehicles.\r\n\r\nHondaLink subscription package may be required.",
    "descriptionHTML": "New for 2024 Prologue: with the HondaLink app, you can take control with remote commands, check your charge status, locate your vehicle, and redeem your charging credits* for EVgo charging network. Activate HondaLink Connected by OnStar in the app for safety and connectivity services.<br><br>Use HondaLink\u00ae app with compatible Honda vehicles to access features such as remote commands, vehicle status, scheduling service appointments, roadside assistance, and more.<br><br>Check vehicle compatibility: hondalink.honda.com/#/compatibility<br><br>Features availability:<br>The HondaLink\u00ae app has exciting remote control features like Remote Engine Start, Remote Door Lock/Unlock, and Find My Car. Available for 2018+ Odyssey Touring/Elite, 2018-2022 Accord Touring and 2023+ Accord all trims, 2019+ Insight Touring, 2019+ Pilot Touring/Elite/Black Edition*, 2019+ Passport Touring/Elite*, 2023+ Civic Type R*, 2023+ CR-V Sport Touring Hybrid, and 2023+ Pilot Touring/Elite vehicles. Battery charge monitoring and control is available for Clarity Electric and Plug-in Hybrid vehicles.<br><br>*Remote Engine Start is currently not available for 2019-2022 Pilot Touring/Elite/Black Edition, 2019+ Passport Touring/Elite, and 2023+ Civic Type R vehicles.<br><br>HondaLink subscription package may be required.",
